    - `BuiltinLowering` enumerates strategies for lowering (e.g., `Property`, `Inline`, `MethodRename`, `FunctionRename`).
    - `BuiltinRegistry` stores mappings for methods, functions, and namespaces, initialized with standard Vox-to-TypeScript lowerings (e.g., `str.length()` to `s.length`, `std.time.now_ms()` to `Date.now()`, `list.append` to `list.push`).
